[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12121.99, "timestamp": "03:22:01", "text": "它的反应以及所有类似的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12125.19, "timestamp": "03:22:05", "text": "例如拉普拉斯网站"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12132.469, "timestamp": "03:22:12", "text": "我不知道有什么类似于拉普拉斯的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12136.229, "timestamp": "03:22:16", "text": "当你点击网站时，她的眼睛睁开了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12139.19, "timestamp": "03:22:19", "text": "当你点击她的时候，还会出现一些其他的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12143.269, "timestamp": "03:22:23", "text": "她很喜欢她早上做的ASMR。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12146.309, "timestamp": "03:22:26", "text": "她脑袋上听不到任何声音，但是，嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12149.269, "timestamp": "03:22:29", "text": "比如你可以点击头部来拍打它，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12152.71, "timestamp": "03:22:32", "text": "我猜大概是这样吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12155.03, "timestamp": "03:22:35", "text": "当你悬停时，这会产生很好的效果。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12157.67, "timestamp": "03:22:37", "text": "超过它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12167.59, "timestamp": "03:22:47", "text": "它知道。这真是太……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12170.87, "timestamp": "03:22:50", "text": "这真是太酷了。像但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12173.349, "timestamp": "03:22:53", "text": "是的，这个网站现在有主题了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12176.07, "timestamp": "03:22:56", "text": "东西。看看这个。它有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12178.389, "timestamp": "03:22:58", "text": "主题方面。"}]